      IN ONE BOX.
    </h2>

    <!-- Interactive / Kinetic Floating Discipline Badges with Glitch physics -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 mb-16 font-mono-tech text-center">
      <div class="p-6 bg-[#F3F1EB] text-[#0A0F14] brutal-border-thick font-bold brutal-shadow-hover hover:bg-[#4A9EFF] hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer">
